#!/bin/sh
# platform: macOS-only -- shipyard's uninstall hook runs on Mac OS X 10.9
cat <<'MSG'
To go back to Mavericks Forever, after this uninstall finishes, rerun https://mavericksforever.com/claude/install.sh
Each user's home keeps what Claude Code for Mavericks put there:
  ~/Library/Caches/dev.mavergreen.claude-code (patched copies of Claude Code)
  ~/Library/Application Support/dev.mavergreen.claude-code (the launcher's records)
  ~/.local/bin/claude, when it is the link to the launcher (it now points at nothing)
To remove them, each user runs:
  rm -rf ~/Library/Caches/dev.mavergreen.claude-code ~/Library/Application\ Support/dev.mavergreen.claude-code
  [ "$(readlink ~/.local/bin/claude)" = /usr/local/mavergreen/bin/claude ] && rm -f ~/.local/bin/claude
MSG
